        "original_id": "b318cd5d-7eae-535d-bc56-de948f4640ca",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carrie Coon, Lee Pace, Ben Affleck, Rosamund Pike\n- Films: Gone Girl, The Keeping Hours\n- Characters: Margo Dunne, Nick Dunne, Amy\n- Places: Missouri\n\nFacts:\n- In 2014, Carrie Coon starred as Margo Dunne in the thriller film Gone Girl.\n- Gone Girl is set in Missouri and begins as a mystery about the events surrounding Nick Dunne, played by Ben Affleck, after the sudden disappearance of his wife Amy, played by Rosamund Pike.\n- The film The Keeping Hours stars Lee Pace and Carrie Coon.",
